# No deploy without parent

Jacob builds locally with Cursor. Jeff owns Azure, secrets, and production.

## Do not do unless Jeff explicitly asks in this conversation

- `terraform apply`, `terraform destroy`, or Azure CLI resource creates
- Push deploy tokens, Key Vault secret values, or GitHub App keys
- Turn on un-gated production CD
- Register custom domains or Entra apps

## Default workflow

- Edit pages and markdown
- Run `npm run dev` (port 4321)
- Run `npm run lint` before commits
- Work on a branch; Jeff reviews `main`

Local `npm run build` is fine. Publishing to the live internet is Jeff’s job.
